## Tournament Stages

Stages within each tournament, including schedule and progression flags.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| tournament_id | Tournament ID | string | Stable tournament identifier; join using this value. | tournament_id |
| tournament_name | Tournament Name | string | Recorded tournament name. | tournament_name |
| stage_number | Stage Number | integer | Stage order within the tournament. | stage_number |
| stage_name | Stage Name | string | Recorded competition stage, such as group stage or final. | stage_name |
| group_stage | Group Stage | integer | 1 when a group stage applies in this row’s scope, otherwise 0. | group_stage |
| knockout_stage | Knockout Stage | integer | 1 when a knockout stage applies in this row’s scope, otherwise 0. | knockout_stage |
| unbalanced_groups | Unbalanced Groups | integer | 1 when group sizes differ, otherwise 0. | unbalanced_groups |
| start_date | Start Date | string | Stage start date in YYYY-MM-DD format. | start_date |
| end_date | End Date | string | Stage end date in YYYY-MM-DD format. | end_date |
| count_matches | Match Count | integer | Number of matches in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_matches |
| count_teams | Team Count | integer | Number of teams in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_teams |
| count_scheduled | Count Scheduled | integer | Number of scheduled matches in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_scheduled |
| count_replays | Count Replays | integer | Number of replay matches in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_replays |
| count_playoffs | Count Playoffs | integer | Number of playoff matches in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_playoffs |
| count_walkovers | Count Walkovers | integer | Number of walkovers in the row’s tournament, team or stage scope. | count_walkovers |

